---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Pending from "../components/Pending.astro";
import headshot from "../assets/headshot.jpg";
---
<Base title="About" description="Graciela De Leon: AI product manager, Berkeley MBA/MPH, previously ServiceNow AI Platform, pharma, and consumer health.">
  <div class="text prose">
    <Image class="about-photo" src={headshot} alt="Graciela De Leon" width={240} height={240} densities={[1]} />
    <h1 class="case-h">About</h1>
    <p class="lede">I measure whether AI agents actually work: evals before launch, adoption after, and ROI for the business, especially in health.</p>

    <h2>Now</h2>
    <p>I'm finishing an MBA/MPH at UC Berkeley. I build with agents every day, and I treat directing them as a core product skill: every project on this site was built with AI under my specs and review.</p>

    <h2>Before</h2>
    <p>At ServiceNow, on the AI Platform team, I redefined the core AI agent adoption metric across 3K enterprise accounts, cutting false positives from 15% to 2.8%, and built the customer-facing AI ROI framework.</p>
    <p>Before Berkeley, I was a product manager in pharma, on a $26M prescription business, and in consumer health, where I launched a longevity app to 40K+ downloads.</p>
    <p>My brand and marketing background shapes how I think about strategy and go-to-market: <Pending what="details" /></p>

    <h2>Get in touch</h2>
    <p>Email, LinkedIn, and GitHub are below.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
